[
  {"comment": "Emboss by projection (mitcad#1091) on OCCT. A ball of radius 20 about the origin (Sphere1 F1, Body1 F1.b0, its face F1:side0; poles on Z): 4/3 pi 20^3."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "sphere", "plane": "xy", "center": [0, 0], "diameter": 40, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Sphere1", "status": "ok", "body": "F1.b0", "volume": 33510.32163829112}},

  {"comment": "Sketch1 (F2) on XZ (normal +Y): a 6 x 6 square about the origin, projected along +Y onto the ball (its +Y side) and raised 1 along the sphere's normals (Emboss1, F3). The walls run along the radii, so the volume grows by the bottom's solid angle times (21^3 - 20^3) / 3: the bottom's area is 4 F(3, 3), F(x, y) = R (x asin(y / sqrt(R^2 - x^2)) + y asin(x / sqrt(R^2 - y^2)) - R atan(x y / (R sqrt(R^2 - x^2 - y^2)))), R = 20: 36.27434255687, so 38.11828830351 more."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create", "plane": "xz"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F2", "corner": [-3, -3], "width": 6, "height": 6},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "emboss",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F2", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "face": {"body": "F1.b0", "face": "F1:side0"}, "depth": 1}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Emboss1", "status": "ok", "body": "F1.b0", "volume": 33548.439926594634,
    "has_face": "F3:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b0", "has_face": "F3:side(c1[c4,c2])"}},
  {"comment": "The top reaches the sphere of radius 21 over the square's middle."},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b0", "min": [-20, -20, -20], "max": [20, 21, 20], "tolerance": 1e-5}},
  {"comment": "Sunk 1 instead: the bottom's solid angle times (20^3 - 19^3) / 3 less."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F3", "def": {"type": "emboss",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F2", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "face": {"body": "F1.b0", "face": "F1:side0"}, "depth": 1, "mode": "sink"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Emboss1", "status": "ok", "body": "F1.b0", "volume": 33475.830784243306,
    "has_face": "F3:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})"}},

  {"comment": "Sketch2 (F4) on XZ: 'Mitcad' in the bundled font, height 6, its baseline at z = 12 (above the square), projected onto the ball and raised 1 (Emboss2, F5)."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create", "plane": "xz"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_text", "sketch": "F4", "text": "Mitcad", "at": [-9, -12], "height": 6},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "emboss", "profiles": [
    {"sketch": "F4", "region": "r{t1.g0.c0}"}, {"sketch": "F4", "region": "r{t1.g1.c0}"},
    {"sketch": "F4", "region": "r{t1.g1.c1}"}, {"sketch": "F4", "region": "r{t1.g2.c0}"},
    {"sketch": "F4", "region": "r{t1.g3.c0}"}, {"sketch": "F4", "region": "r{t1.g4.c0}"},
    {"sketch": "F4", "region": "r{t1.g5.c0}"}],
    "face": {"body": "F1.b0", "face": "F1:side0"}, "depth": 1}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Emboss2", "status": "ok", "body": "F1.b0", "has_face": "F5:end(r{t1.g0.c0})"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b0", "has_face": "F5:end(r{t1.g5.c0})"}},

  {"comment": "A free-form face: a second ball 40 across at (100, 0, 0) (Sphere2 F6, Body2 F6.b0) scaled by 0.5 along Z about its centre (Scale1, F7): an ellipsoid, its face a B-spline still named F6:side0."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "sphere", "plane": "xy", "center": [100, 0], "diameter": 40, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "scale", "bodies": ["F6.b0"], "point": {"type": "fixed", "point": [100, 0, 0]},
