  {"comment": "Sketch4 (F10) on XY: a 10 x 6 rectangle from (115, -3) reaches past the ellipsoid's rim at x = 120: refused, the profile named (Emboss4, F11)."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F10", "corner": [115, -3], "width": 10, "height": 6},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "emboss",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F10", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "face": {"body": "F6.b0", "face": "F6:side0"}, "depth": 1}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Emboss4", "status": "error",
    "error_contains": "the profile r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]} falls partly off face F6:side0"}},

  {"comment": "A direction: a box 40 x 40 x 10 from (180, -20) (Box1 F12, Body3 F12.b0); Sketch5 (F13) on XY: a 4 x 4 square from (190, 0), projected along (1, 0, 1) onto the box's top (10 up: it lands 10 further along X, x 200..204) and raised 1 (Emboss5, F14): 16 more, the centre of mass (16000 (200, 0, 5) + 16 (202, 2, 10.5)) / 16016."},
